{"message":"fix(source): preserve indexed recursion while rejecting unrefined captures\n\nReplace family-wide direct-field refusals with a metered transitive capture\naudit of the completed branch term. Retain captures through local types,\nlet values, and unused arguments as typed refusals; constructor-local\nindices remain usable. Finish other branches before the final refusal so\na real unresolved self-reference can select the existing recursion retry.\n\nUnchanged main reproduces eight recursive-source failures. Preserve all\nexisting negative tests and original motive obligations, and add two\nregressions for field-only branches, shadowing, aliases and unused terms.\nBoth checking engines remain mandatory; no new admission authority.","paths":["crates/fln-elab/src/source/matching.rs","crates/fln/tests/source_matching.rs"],"sha256":"ead08c0adb8d2d89d95fd1d09e1b5078a39b45091360c5f162a25fa859339f1c","base_blobs":{"crates/fln-elab/src/source/matching.rs":"10556b7cc117c085e419802063639a4d0c318ea3","crates/fln/tests/source_matching.rs":"380aa00d5062e2a8f9ef16f1bdfc5ab99be323ec"},"source_sha256":{"crates/fln-elab/src/source/matching.rs":"bf2d03d4439185eec5cbe9ea81ff3bb84d7fc7fcf064f079d3f5f65f0cf79319","crates/fln/tests/source_matching.rs":"83ba69d1d96e259f200b072f9f6027850978c284d2b01acc5e4dc3ec3ce6da1a"},"examples":[],"patch_gzip_base64":""}
